opening two files
tabs open=2
the menu holds: tab-close, tab-copy-path
active doc is README.md
first tab's label carries its id: doc-1
the menu is open on that tab=true
copying that tab's path
action=copied-path
status: copied .../main.bas
the path it offered is absolute: true
and names the file: true
-- closing that tab from its own menu, while the other is active --
action=closed
tabs open=1
  still open: README.md
-- and the label survives a redraw, so the gesture does too --
after a redraw the label still carries: doc-2
app-exited
